{"version":1,"key":"card:698","content":{"id":698,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b312a2c3-d02e-421f-af15-19bc298c1cc0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在赌场里，筹码按颜色区分价值，蓝色筹码往往代表最高面值。这一意象后来被引入了金融市场，用来形容那些历史悠久、规模庞大、盈利稳定且信誉卓著的上市公司，它们通常穿越了多个经济周期依然屹立，被投资者视为相对安全的长期持仓选择，这便是\"蓝筹股\"的由来。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1778064299358_fe829acc-baae-4ab7-94d7-bb19e9d66497.webp","alt":"蓝筹股示意图","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1778064299358_fe829acc-baae-4ab7-94d7-bb19e9d66497.webp","width":627.7929024804367,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6aac9b20-ec51-431f-99e7-473785301876","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["金融/股票","概念"],"createTime":1778064158131,"updateTime":1778064453128,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1778064453128}}